[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど、お前はノーヴァ神聖国の……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, so you're from the sacred lands of Nova..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっきの島で、大体の事情は聞いたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard most of the details back on that island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣の存在は、我が国にとっても脅威。\n可能な範囲で協力するわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Apexi is a threat to our nation as well. I'll help however I can."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そりゃあ心強い。よろしく頼むぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's reassuring. We're counting on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうあいつの縄張りには入ってるって話だったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we're already in its territory, aren't we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつ襲ってきてもおかしくねえ。\n気を引き締めろよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It could strike at any moment. Stay sharp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wha-?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この大波は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These waves..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "空までが、あっという間に真っ暗に……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The sky... it turned pitch black in an instant...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来やがったか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it's here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あああああああ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "AAAAAAAAH"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお……おオオ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhh... OHHH..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "男の人や女の人……色んな……人の……声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Men and women... so many... different... voices..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頭の中に、直接聞こえてくるような……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's as if they're echoing directly in our minds..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェから、話は聞いてたけど……不気味ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze warned us about this, but... it's unsettling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ウウ……アアア……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uuuu... Aaah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あの時と同じだ。\nやっぱり俺の気のせいじゃなかったか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Just like that time. So I wasn't imagining things after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの頂獣には、餌食となった者の怨念が\n取りついていると言われている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They say the Apexi is haunted by the grudges of its victims."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、あれはそれを拒むどころか、\n使役して自分の力に変えているの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But rather than reject them, it harnesses those voices and turns them into its own power."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むかつく野郎だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a twisted beast."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ツェ、ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...tze, Lanze"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なに！？\u3000この声は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! That voice..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラなのか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Barbara...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェ。どうしてあんたは生きてるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze. Why are you still alive?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "声",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Voice"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ってめぇぇぇぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラの声で、勝手なことを\nほざいてんじゃあねぇぇぇぇ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "DON'T YOU DARE USE BARBARA'S VOICE!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姿を現しやがれ！\u3000クヴァレルガ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Show yourself, Kvarelga!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出たな！\u3000総員！\u3000戦闘準備だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There it is! All hands, battle stations!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てめえのために、錬金術士総出で用意してやったぜ！\nくらいやがれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've got a special alchemical welcome prepared just for you! Take this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よしっ、効いてる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! It's working!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "対頂獣用の装備、改良した甲斐がありましたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those equipment modifications for the Apexi are paying off!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "逃げるんじゃねぇ！\nてめえは絶対に俺が倒してやる！！\u3000追撃だ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't you run away! I'll be the one to finish you off!! After it!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ダメです、ランツェさん！\u3000深追いは危険です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, Captain Lanze! It's too dangerous to pursue!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だ、だが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "B-but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "相手はもう射程外です。弾を無駄遣いせず、\nレスナさんたちに任せて機会を窺いましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's already out of range. Don't waste ammunition—let's wait for Resna's team and look for another opportunity."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大切なことは、\nみんなで確実に頂獣を倒すことなんですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What matters is that we defeat the Apexi together, as a team."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……っ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ngh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ……その通りだな、天使ちゃん。\nすまねえ、おかげで頭が冷えた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're right, angel. Thanks for cooling my head."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな！\u3000次の接近に備えるぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! Prepare for its next approach!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, sir!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]